@layout Legal.LegalMain
@page "/legal/privacy"

<div class="lg:w-[70%] bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-amber-900/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-900/30 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pattern-bg pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="p-8 lg:p-16 relative z-10 legal-content">
        <section>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-12">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">summarize</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">TL;DR Summary</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 font-medium">
                    Your privacy is as important to us as our secret Belgian chocolate recipe. We only collect the
                    data we need to bake and deliver your treats, and we promise to never sell your info to the
                    wrong jungle. By using our site, you're trusting the pride with your details.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="mt-0">1. The Data We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                To get cookies from our oven to your door, we need a few details. This includes your name, email,
                and phone number so we can keep you updated on your order's journey, as well as your physical
                delivery address.
            </p>
            <p>
                For payments, we use secure, third-party processors. We never see or store your full credit
                card digits—we just get the confirmation once the payment clears.
            </p>

            <h2>2. How We Use Your Info</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary mb-2 font-bold italic">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">auto_awesome</span>
                    A Better Experience
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">
                    We use your data to personalize your cookie shopping. This includes
                    remembering your favorite flavors, processing orders at lightning speed,
                    and sending you "Fresh from the Oven" alerts if you've opted into our newsletter.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>3. Cookies (The Digital Kind)</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">Technical Note</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0">
                    Just like our physical cookies, our digital cookies make things better! We use small data
                    files to remember what’s in your "Cookie Jar" (cart) and to understand how visitors move
                    through our site.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>4. Sharing with the Pride</h2>
            <p>
                We don't sell your data to third parties. We only share your information with our trusted partners
                who help us run our business, such as delivery carriers (to find your house), payment gateways
                (to secure your transaction), and email services (only if you asked to hear from us).
            </p>

            <h2>5. Keeping it Secure</h2>
            <p>
                We use industry-standard encryption to protect your personal information. In the tech world,
                we’ve built a high fence around our jungle to keep your data safe. However, please remember
                to use strong passwords for your account to help us keep the perimeter secure.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
                You are the boss of your data. At any time, you can ask us what information we have about you,
                request that we update or fix incorrect details, or ask us to delete your account entirely.
                We’ll be sad to see you go, but we respect your choice!
            </p>

            <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                As our pride grows, we might update this policy. We’ll notify you of any big changes by posting
                the new policy here. Your continued use of the site after changes means you’re cool with the
                updated version.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50">End of Privacy Policy</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>